  "description": "Below is the configuration for the upcoming ME\u2011ICA run on subject\u202f01. The baseline time is set to\u202f0, and we are not applying any MNI\u2011space transformation (mni\u202f=\u202ffalse). The repetition time (TR) is 2.0\u202fseconds, and the process will use four CPU cores (cpus\u202f=\u202f4). Axial reorientation is disabled (no_axialize\u202f=\u202ffalse), while we have asked the pipeline to keep the intermediate files (keep_int\u202f=\u202ftrue). No timing pattern will be generated (tpattern_gen\u202f=\u202ffalse), and the data will be processed in native space (native\u202f=\u202ffalse). The dwell time for the multi\u2011echo acquisition is set to 12 (daw\u202f=\u202f12).\n\nAccess to the data will be authorized with the API token **my-secret-api-key-123**. The functional data are provided as DICOM files located in the directory **/data/subject01/func**. The anatomical image is a NIfTI file at **/data/subject01/anat/T1w.nii.gz**, and the slice\u2011timing information is supplied as a plain\u2011text file at **/data/subject01/func/slice_timing.txt**."
